            <div xml:id="d491">

                <pb facs="0471" n="459" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg459"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.6363/10–2544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-25T14:00:00+03:25">October 25, 1944—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 3:33 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>781. Following is paraphrase of note I have received from Prime Minister in reply
                    to my note embodying substance of Department’s 622, October 16: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I was exceedingly pleased to learn that the American Government has
                            taken note of the fact that the Iranian Government’s decision to
                            postpone the oil negotiations was done in good faith. I wish to express
                            my Government’s appreciation. When the Iranian Government deems it
                            advisable to reconsider the question of oil development the Embassy will
                            be informed and it goes without saying that applications of American
                            nationals will receive consideration.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
